This license covers the original work in this repository: `fw/`, `tools/`, and
the documentation (`firmware-guide.md`, `geekbar-pulse-x2-salvage.md`).

`firmware/` is vendored third-party code, under its own license:

- `firmware/PY32F0xx_HAL_Driver` and the PY32 support files — MIT,
  Copyright (c) 2025 Tube Time. See `firmware/LICENSE`.
- `firmware/CMSIS` — ARM CMSIS, Apache-2.0. Only the headers are used; the
  CMSIS DSP library was removed because nothing here references it.

The Geek Bar Pulse X2 stock firmware image is **not** included. It is Geek
Bar's copyrighted work and is not redistributed here. See
`geekbar-pulse-x2-salvage.md` for how to dump your own unit, and the sha256
published there to check it against.
